WKnn is an improvement on the original K nearest neighbor rule. Its basic idea is to weight the evidence of the neighbor according to the similarities with the unknown sample, and the larger the similarity is, the more voting rights the neighbor will have. The similarity of any two samples xA and xB is measured in a max-min method as below4\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
